        <a class=\"me-menu__action-link t-14\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/?trk=help_me_menu\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" data-test-id=\"me-menu-associated-product\">\n                Go to LinkedIn\n              </a>\n        </section>\n\n          <a class=\"artdeco-button artdeco-button--primary\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/checkpoint/lg/login?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww%2Elinkedin%2Ecom%2Fhelp%2Flinkedin%2Fanswer%2Fa422337&amp;trk=help_me_menu\" data-test-id=\"me-menu-sign-in\">\n            Sign in\n          </a>\n      \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  \n  \n        <a class=\"site-navigation__sign-in artdeco-button artdeco-button--2 artdeco-button--secondary artdeco-button--inverse mobile-excluded\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/checkpoint/lg/login?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww%2Elinkedin%2Ecom%2Fhelp%2Flinkedin%2Fanswer%2Fa422337\" data-test-id=\"sign-in-button\">Sign in</a>\n\n    </nav>\n\n<!---->  \n      </div>\n    </header>\n  \n        \n        <main role=\"main\" tabindex=\"-1\" id=\"a11y-main\" class=\"layout layout--one-column\" aria-label=\"Help content\" data-inert-toggle-target=\"me-menu-inert-toggle-target\">\n          \n        <div class=\"article-details-page\">\n<!---->          \n    <div class=\"hue-page-heading\" data-test-selector=\"heading-container\">\n      <div class=\"page-width-content\">\n        <h1 class=\"hue-page-heading__title hue-default-color t-24 t-bold\" data-test-selector=\"heading-title\">\n          Engagement ad objective \n        </h1>\n        \n            \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    <span class=\"hue-default-secondary-color t-14\" data-test-selector=\"relativeTime-container\">\n        \n              Last updated: 1 month ago\n            \n    </span>\n  \n          \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  \n\n          <div class=\"page-width-content article-details-content\">\n            <div class=\"article-details-content__main \">\n              <article data-test-selector=\"article\" data-article-source=\"urn:li:helpCenterArticle:(422337,LITHOGRAPH)\">\n                  \n      \n    <div class=\"t-14 article-content__rich-text hue-default-color\" data-test-selector=\"preRenderedMarkup-container\">\n      <p>Increase engagement on your content through likes, comments, shares, follows, and clicks to a landing page or LinkedIn Page when you select engagement as your ad set objective. The engagement ad objective is in the middle of the marketing funnel, which aims to help your audiences consider your business for their needs.&nbsp;</p>\n    </div>\n  \n  \n                  \n      \n    <div class=\"t-14 article-content__rich-text hue-default-color\" data-test-selector=\"preRenderedMarkup-container\">\n      <h2>Available ad formats, bidding strategies, and optimization goals</h2>\n    </div>\n  \n  \n                  \n      \n    <div class=\"t-14 article-content__rich-text hue-default-color\" data-test-selector=\"preRenderedMarkup-container\">\n      <p>We surface only ad formats, bidding strategies, and optimization goals that support your objective of increasing engagement. Engagement clicks are selected as your optimization goal by default.&nbsp;</p><p>The ad formats, bidding strategies, and optimization goals available vary depending on the setting. Learn more about the available options in the following table:</p>\n    </div>\n  \n  \n                  \n      \n    <div class=\"t-14 article-content__rich-text hue-default-color article-content__rich-text-table\" data-test-selector=\"preRenderedMarkup-container\">\n      <table class=\"artdeco-table--striped\"><thead class=\"artdeco-table-header\"><tr class=\"artdeco-table-row\"><th scope=\"col\" class=\"artdeco-table-header\">Setting</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"artdeco-table-header\">Available options</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"artdeco-table-row\"><td class=\"artdeco-table-cell\">Ad formats</td><td class=\"artdeco-table-cell\"><ul><li><p>Single image</p></li><li><p>Carousel image</p></li><li><p>Video</p></li><li><p>Event</p></li><li><p>Document</p></li><li>Thought leader</li><li>Article and newsletter</li><li><p>Conversation</p></li><li><p>Follower</p></li></ul></td></tr><tr class=\"artdeco-table-row\"><td class=\"artdeco-table-cell\">Bidding strategies</td><td class=\"artdeco-table-cell\"><ul><li><p>Maximum delivery (automated)</p></li><li><p>Cost cap</p></li><li><p>Manual bidding</p></li></ul></td></tr><tr class=\"artdeco-table-row\"><td class=\"artdeco-table-cell\">Optimization goals</td><td class=\"artdeco-table-cell\"><ul><li><p>Engagement clicks</p></li><li><p>Impressions</p></li><li><p>Sends (Sponsored Messaging ad formats only)</p></li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table>\n    </div>\n  \n  \n                  \n      \n    <div class=\"t-14 article-content__rich-text hue-default-color\" data-test-selector=\"preRenderedMarkup-container\">\n      <h2>Reporting metrics</h2>\n    </div>\n  \n  \n                  \n      \n    <div class=\"t-14 article-content__rich-text hue-default-color\" data-test-selector=\"preRenderedMarkup-container\">\n      <p>Getting people to engage with your content is the key result of engagement ad sets. View a wide variety of reporting metrics from the Campaign Manager reporting dashboard, including:&nbsp;</p><ul><li>Performance metrics&nbsp;</li><li>Engagement&nbsp;</li><li>Conversions&nbsp;</li><li>Bid and Budget&nbsp;</li></ul><p>You can also view professional demographic data about members who are interacting with your ads.&nbsp;</p>\n    </div>\n  \n  \n                  \n      \n    <div class=\"t-14 article-content__rich-text hue-default-color\" data-test-selector=\"preRenderedMarkup-container\">\n      <p><strong>Learn more</strong></p>\n    </div>\n  \n  \n                  \n      \n    <div class=\"t-14 article-content__rich-text hue-default-color\" data-test-selector=\"preRenderedMarkup-container\">\n      <ul><li><a rel=\"\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/help/lms/answer/a424254\" target=\"_self\">Chargeable clicks for engagement ad sets</a></li><li><a rel=\"\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/help/lms/answer/a422642\" target=\"_self\">Objective-based reporting with key results</a></li><li><a rel=\"\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/help/lms/answer/a1399568\" target=\"_self\">Thought leader ads</a></li><li><a rel=\"\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/help/lms/answer/a5966218\" target=\"_self\">Article and newsletter ads</a></li><li><a rel=\"\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/help/lms/answer/a8635043\" target=\"_self\">Flexible ads</a></li></ul>\n    </div>\n  \n  \n              </article>\n                \n    \n    \n    \n\n    <section class=\"people-also-viewed\">\n      <h3 class=\"people-also-viewed__header t-bold t-black t-20\">People also viewed</h3>\n      <ul class=\"people-also-viewed__article-list\">\n          <li class=\"people-also-viewed__article-list-item\" data-test-selector=\"people-also-viewed-article-list-item\">\n            \n    <div class=\"collapsible\" data-test-selector=\"collapsible\">\n      <button aria-controls=\"collapsible__body-tehx9\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"collapsible__trigger plain-button people-also-viewed__collapsible-trigger\" data-test-selector=\"collapsible-trigger\" type=\"button\">\n        \n                <span class=\"t-16 t-open people-also-viewed__article-title\" data-test-selector=\"people-also-viewed-article-title\">\n                  Follower ads\n                </span>\n              \n        <li-icon size=\"large\" color=\"inverse\" class=\"collapsible__icon \" data-test-selector=\"collapsible-icon\" type=\"chevron-down-icon\"></li-icon>\n      </button>\n\n      <div id=\"collapsible__body-tehx9\" class=\"collapsible__body people-also-viewed__collapsible-body\" data-test-selector=\"collapsible-body\" hidden tabindex=\"-1\">\n        <div class=\"collapsible__content\">\n          \n                  \n      \n    <div class=\"t-14 article-content__rich-text hue-default-color\" data-test-selector=\"preRenderedMarkup-container\">\n      <p>Follower ads encourage members to follow your LinkedIn or Showcase Page with a single click.&nbsp;Follower ads use LinkedIn profile data, such as a member’s name or company name to create a more&nbsp;dynamic and&nbsp;personal&nbsp;ad experience.&nbsp;Keep in mind:&nbsp;</p><ul><li>Follower ads can appear differently to member accounts in your target audience, depending on whether or not they already follow your LinkedIn Page.&nbsp;</li><li>Clicks on&nbsp;the&nbsp;Follow button&nbsp;enable&nbsp;members to&nbsp;follow your organization and&nbsp;will&nbsp;redirect them&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;Overview tab of your LinkedIn Page.&nbsp;</li></ul>\n    </div>\n  \n  \n              \n        </div>\n\n          <div class=\"collapsible__body-footer\">\n            \n                \n    <a href=\"/help/linkedin/answer/a423314?trk=hc-articlePage-peopleAlsoViewed\" class=\"people-also-viewed__article-link\" data-test-selector=\"people-also-viewed-article-link\" aria-label=\"Read help article “Follower ads”\">\n                  Read more\n                  <li-icon class=\"people-also-viewed__article-link-icon svg-icon\" size=\"small\" aria-hidden=\"true\" type=\"arrow-right-icon\"></li-icon>\n                </a>\n  \n              \n          </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  \n          </li>\n          <li class=\"people-also-viewed__article-list-item\" data-test-selector=\"people-also-viewed-article-list-item\">\n            \n    <div class=\"collapsible\" data-test-selector=\"collapsible\">\n      <button aria-controls=\"collapsible__body-41a2m\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"collapsible__trigger plain-button people-also-viewed__collapsible-trigger\" data-test-selector=\"collapsible-trigger\" type=\"button\">\n        \n                <span class=\"t-16 t-open people-also-viewed__article-title\" data-test-selector=\"people-also-viewed-article-title\">\n                  Brand awareness ad objective\n                </span>\n              \n        <li-icon size=\"large\" color=\"inverse\" class=\"collapsible__icon \" data-test-selector=\"collapsible-icon\" type=\"chevron-down-icon\"></li-icon>\n      </button>\n\n      <div id=\"collapsible__body-41a2m\" class=\"collapsible__body people-also-viewed__collapsible-body\" data-test-selector=\"collapsible-body\" hidden tabindex=\"-1\">\n        <div class=\"collapsible__content\">\n          \n                  \n      \n    <div class=\"t-14 article-content__rich-text hue-default-color\" data-test-selector=\"preRenderedMarkup-container\">\n      <p>Tell more people about your products, services, or organization by selecting the brand awareness objective for your ad sets. The&nbsp;ad formats, bidding strategies,&nbsp;and optimization goals&nbsp;available for brand awareness ad sets&nbsp;optimize towards the reach or impressions of your ads.</p>\n    </div>\n  \n  \n                  \n      \n    <div class=\"t-14 article-content__rich-text hue-default-color\" data-test-selector=\"preRenderedMarkup-container\">\n      <h2>Available ad formats, bidding strategies, and optimization goals</h2>\n    </div>\n  \n  \n                  \n      \n    <div class=\"t-14 article-content__rich-text hue-default-color\" data-test-selector=\"preRenderedMarkup-container\">\n      <p>We surface only ad formats, bidding strategies, and optimization goals that support telling more people about your products, services, or organization. Brand awareness ad sets automatically select reach or impressions as the optimization goal, depending on the ad format and bidding strategy selected.&nbsp;</p><p>The ad formats, bidding strategies, and optimization goals available vary depending on the setting. Learn more about the available options in the following table:</p>\n    </div>\n  \n  \n              \n        </div>\n\n          <div class=\"collapsible__body-footer\">\n            \n                \n    <a href=\"/help/linkedin/answer/a422075?trk=hc-articlePage-peopleAlsoViewed\" class=\"people-also-viewed__article-link\" data-test-selector=\"people-also-viewed-article-link\" aria-label=\"Read help article “Brand awareness ad objective”\">\n                  Read more\n                  <li-icon class=\"people-also-viewed__article-link-icon svg-icon\" size=\"small\" aria-hidden=\"true\" type=\"arrow-right-icon\"></li-icon>\n                </a>\n  \n              \n          </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  \n          </li>\n          <li class=\"people-also-viewed__article-list-item\" data-test-selector=\"people-also-viewed-article-list-item\">\n            \n    <div class=\"collapsible\" data-test-selector=\"collapsible\">\n      <button aria-controls=\"collapsible__body-osyid\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"collapsible__trigger plain-button people-also-viewed__collapsible-trigger\" data-test-selector=\"collapsible-trigger\" type=\"button\">\n        \n                <span class=\"t-16 t-open people-also-viewed__article-title\" data-test-selector=\"people-also-viewed-article-title\">\n                  Website visits ad objective \n                </span>\n              \n        <li-icon size=\"large\" color=\"inverse\" class=\"collapsible__icon \" data-test-selector=\"collapsible-icon\" type=\"chevron-down-icon\"></li-icon>\n      </button>\n\n      <div id=\"collapsible__body-osyid\" class=\"collapsible__body people-also-viewed__collapsible-body\" data-test-selector=\"collapsible-body\" hidden tabindex=\"-1\">\n        <div class=\"collapsible__content\">\n          \n                  \n      \n    <div class=\"t-14 article-content__rich-text hue-default-color\" data-test-selector=\"preRenderedMarkup-container\">\n      <p>Encourage members to visit your website or landing page when you select website visits as your ad set objective. Website visits ad sets are shown to those most likely to click on your ad, which directs them to your website, landing page, or other URL. The website visits ad objective is in the middle of the marketing funnel, which aims to help your audiences consider your business for their needs.</p>\n    </div>\n  \n  \n                  \n      \n    <div class=\"t-14 article-content__rich-text hue-default-color\" data-test-selector=\"preRenderedMarkup-container\">\n      <h2>Available ad formats, bidding strategies, and optimization goals</h2>\n    </div>\n  \n  \n              \n        </div>\n\n          <div class=\"collapsible__body-footer\">\n            \n                \n    <a href=\"/help/linkedin/answer/a420934?trk=hc-articlePage-peopleAlsoViewed\" class=\"people-also-viewed__article-link\" data-test-selector=\"people-also-viewed-article-link\" aria-label=\"Read help article “Website visits ad objective ”\">\n                  Read more\n                  <li-icon class=\"people-also-viewed__article-link-icon svg-icon\" size=\"small\" aria-hidden=\"true\" type=\"arrow-right-icon\"></li-icon>\n                </a>\n  \n              \n          </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  \n          </li>\n          <li class=\"people-also-viewed__article-list-item\" data-test-selector=\"people-also-viewed-article-list-item\">\n            \n    <div class=\"collapsible\" data-test-selector=\"collapsible\">\n      <button aria-controls=\"collapsible__body-o15of\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"collapsible__trigger plain-button people-also-viewed__collapsible-trigger\" data-test-selector=\"collapsible-trigger\" type=\"button\">\n        \n                <span class=\"t-16 t-open people-also-viewed__article-title\" data-test-selector=\"people-also-viewed-article-title\">\n                  Increase followers for Sponsored Content by using the Follow button\n                </span>\n              \n        <li-icon size=\"large\" color=\"inverse\" class=\"collapsible__icon \" data-test-selector=\"collapsible-icon\" type=\"chevron-down-icon\"></li-icon>\n      </button>\n\n      <div id=\"collapsible__body-o15of\" class=\"collapsible__body people-also-viewed__collapsible-body\" data-test-selector=\"collapsible-body\" hidden tabindex=\"-1\">\n        <div class=\"collapsible__content\">\n          \n                  \n      \n    <div class=\"t-14 article-content__rich-text hue-default-color\" data-test-selector=\"preRenderedMarkup-container\">\n      <p>As an advertiser, when you create a Sponsored Content ad set with the engagement objective, a <strong>Follow</strong> button is added to your ads by default. This feature helps you gain followers for your Page.</p>\n    </div>\n  \n  \n                  \n      \n    <div class=\"t-14 article-content__rich-text hue-default-color\" data-test-selector=\"preRenderedMarkup-container\">\n      <p>When members click the <strong>Follow</strong> button on your Sponsored Content, they'll be following your Page and your Page’s posts will appear on their feed.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n    </div>\n  \n  \n                  \n      \n    <div class=\"t-14 article-content__rich-text hue-default-color\" data-test-selector=\"preRenderedMarkup-container\">\n      <p>You'll be charged for any clicks on the button for Cost-per-Click (CPC) ad sets. You will not be charged for clicks on the <strong>Follow</strong> button if you're running a Cost-per-1,000 impressions (CPM) ad set.</p>\n    </div>\n  \n  \n              \n        </div>\n\n          <div class=\"collapsible__body-footer\">\n            \n                \n    <a href=\"/help/linkedin/answer/a422832?trk=hc-articlePage-peopleAlsoViewed\" class=\"people-also-viewed__article-link\" data-test-selector=\"people-also-viewed-article-link\" aria-label=\"Read help article “Increase followers for Sponsored Content by using the Follow button”\">\n                  Read more\n                  <li-icon class=\"people-also-viewed__article-link-icon svg-icon\" size=\"small\" aria-hidden=\"true\" type=\"arrow-right-icon\"></li-icon>\n                </a>\n  \n              \n          </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  \n          </li>\n          <li class=\"people-also-viewed__article-list-item\" data-test-selector=\"people-also-viewed-article-list-item\">\n            \n    <div class=\"collapsible\" data-test-selector=\"collapsible\">\n      <button aria-controls=\"collapsible__body-11p1q\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"collapsible__trigger plain-button people-also-viewed__collapsible-trigger\" data-test-selector=\"collapsible-trigger\" type=\"button\">\n        \n                <span class=\"t-16 t-open people-also-viewed__article-title\" data-test-selector=\"people-also-viewed-article-title\">\n                  Dynamic ads\n                </span>\n              \n        <li-icon size=\"large\" color=\"inverse\" class=\"collapsible__icon \" data-test-selector=\"collapsible-icon\" type=\"chevron-down-icon\"></li-icon>\n      </button>\n\n      <div id=\"collapsible__body-11p1q\" class=\"collapsible__body people-also-viewed__collapsible-body\" data-test-selector=\"collapsible-body\" hidden tabindex=\"-1\">\n        <div class=\"collapsible__content\">\n          \n                  \n      \n    <div class=\"t-14 article-content__rich-text hue-default-color\" data-test-selector=\"preRenderedMarkup-container\">\n      <p>Dynamic ads are personalized ads served in the right rail tailored to each member based on their own LinkedIn profile data, such as profile photo, company name, or job title. Personalization features are also available in Sponsored Content and Sponsored Messaging ads through supported macros and member account ads personalization settings. Learn more about <a rel=\"\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/help/lms/answer/a424137\" target=\"_self\">personalization options for your LinkedIn ads</a>.</p>\n    </div>\n  \n  \n              \n        </div>\n\n          <div class=\"collapsible__body-footer\">\n            \n                \n    <a href=\"/help/linkedin/answer/a421292?trk=hc-articlePage-peopleAlsoViewed\" class=\"people-also-viewed__article-link\" data-test-selector=\"people-also-viewed-article-link\" aria-label=\"Read help article “Dynamic ads”\">\n                  Read more\n                  <li-icon class=\"people-also-viewed__article-link-icon svg-icon\" size=\"small\" aria-hidden=\"true\" type=\"arrow-right-icon\"></li-icon>\n                </a>\n  \n              \n          </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  \n          </li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n  \n<!---->              \n      <div class=\"placeholder \" id=\"helpfulness-rating\">\n        \n      </div>\n  \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"article-details-content__delimiter\"></div>\n            <div class=\"article-details-content__aside \">\n              <aside class=\"page-aside page-aside--full-height\">\n                    <div class=\"article-details-content__tags\">\n                      \n    <h3 id=\"tagged-header\" class=\"hue-web__header--aside t-bold t-16\" data-test-selector=\"topicTags-header\">\n      Tagged in\n    </h3>\n    <ul class=\"pill-list article-page-pill-list hue-artdeco-pill\" data-test-selector=\"topicTags-container\">\n        <li class=\"pill-list__item\" id=\"topic-link-a136037\" data-test-selector=\"topicTags-list-item\">\n          <a class=\"pill basePadding label\" href=\"/help/linkedin/topic/a136037\" data-test-selector=\"topic-tag-link\" aria-describedby=\"tagged-header\">\n            <span data-test-selector=\"topicTags-title-a136037\">\n              Advertising Objectives\n            </span>\n          </a>\n        </li>\n    </ul>\n  \n                    </div>\n<!----><!----><!----><!---->              </aside>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n<!---->        </div>\n\n      \n        </main>\n      \n        \n      <span class=\"placeholder \" id=\"toasts__wormhole\" data-inert-toggle-target=\"me-menu-inert-toggle-target\">\n        \n      </span>\n  \n          \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    <footer class=\"global-footer\" data-inert-toggle-targe